# Deploy only the Flutter web build output. Everything else is
# ignored, including the massive build/ios / build/android trees
# that previously timed out Vercel's file scanner (a "build/ios 2"
# variant with a broken FirebaseCoreInternal symlink hung indefinitely).
#
# Vercel supports negation patterns like git — ignore everything,
# then re-include only build/web and the api/ folder (needed for
# the Vercel Functions declared in vercel.json).
*
!build/
build/*
!build/web/
!api/
!vercel.json
!.vercel/
